# Thumbnail Node Implementation Instructions

## Context

VidFlow now has:
- Core infrastructure ✅
- Trigger Node ✅
- Script Node ✅
- Voice Node ✅
- 115 tests passing

The Thumbnail Node generates YouTube thumbnails based on the video title and style configuration.

---

## Overview

The Thumbnail Node:
1. Receives title and topic context from Script Node
2. Generates multiple thumbnail options (typically 3)
3. Uses AI image generation (Gemini, DALL-E, or Flux)
4. Applies brand style guidelines (colors, typography, layout)
5. Returns image URLs for user selection or auto-selection

